<title>USA: DavCo Restaurants begins trading on AMEX.</title>
<headline>DavCo Restaurants begins trading on AMEX.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The American Stock Exchange said Wednesday it had begun trading common stock of DavCo Restaurants Inc under the symbol &quot;DVC.&quot;</p>
<p>The exchange said DavCo, based in Crofton, Md., is a franchisee of Wendy's International Inc.</p>
<p>It said DavCo operates 228 restaurants in Maryland, northern Virginia, Washington, metropolitan St. Louis, central Illinois and Nashville, Tenn.</p>
<p>Shares of DavCo opened Wednesday at 8-3/4 and were unchanged in afternoon trading.</p>
